spans.s:
P. Ā. -णमति, ˚ते (ind.p. -णम्य) to bend or bow down before (often with मूर्ध्ना, शिरसा &c.), make obeisance to (dat. gen. loc. or acc.), Mn.; MBh. &c.:
Caus. -नामयति or -नमयति, (ind.p. -नमय्य), to cause a person (acc.) to bow before (dat.), Kālid.;
to bow, incline, ib.

√ (2. नश्) P. -णशति, or णश्यति (ep. also Ā. ˚ते; fut. -नङ्क्ष्यति; inf. -नष्टुम्, Pāṇ. viii, 4, 36, Sch.),
to be lost, disappear, vanish, RV. &c. &c.;
to flee, escape, Bhaṭṭ. :
Caus. -णाशयति, to cause to disappear or perish, AV.; ŚBr.; MBh. &c.;
to allow to be lost i.e. leave unrewarded, Hit.

P. Ā. -णयति, ˚ते to lead forwards, conduct, advance, promote, further, RV. &c. &c.;
to bring or lead to, convey (esp. the sacrificial fire or water or Soma to its place at the altar), ib.;
to offer, present, Bhaṭṭ.;
to produce, perform, execute, finish, Up.; MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
to do away with, remove, dispel, MBh.;
to manifest affection, love, desire, MBh.;
to show, represent (a drama), Bālar.; Prasannar.;
to inflict (as punishment), Mn.; MBh. &c.;
to apply (as a clyster), Car.;
to establish, fix, institute, promulgate, teach, MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
to write, compose, Sarvad.;
 (Ā.) to draw in (the breath), ŚBr. :
Desid. -निनीषति (!), to wish to lead or conduct, RV.

प्र-णि-√ धा (Pāṇ. viii, 4, 17) P. Ā. -दधाति, -धत्ते, to place in front, cause to precede, MBh.;
to put down, deposit, ib.;
to place in, bring into (loc.), ib.;
to set (a gem) in (loc.), Hit.;
to put on, apply, Suśr.;
to touch, MBh.;
to turn or direct (the eyes or thoughts) upon (loc.), MBh.; Hariv. &c. (with मनस् and inf. ‘to resolve upon’, Bhaṭṭ.; scil. मनस्, ‘to give the whole attention to, reflect, consider’, MBh.; आत्म प्रणिधीयताम्, ‘one must think’, ib.);
to send out or employ (a spy or emissary), to spy, MBh.; R.;
to find out or ascertain anything (acc.) to be (acc.), MBh.

प्र-णि-√ हन् (Pāṇ. viii, 4, 17) P. -हन्ति, to slay, kill, destroy, extirpate, MBh.; Kāv. (with acc. or gen.; cf. Pāṇ. ii, 3, 56, Sch.);
to bend down lower (the hand), VPrāt.;
to pronounce lower (than Anudātta), ib.

P. Ā. -नवति, ˚ते, to roar, bellow, sound, reverberate, RV.; AV.;
 P. -णौति, to make a humming or droning sound;
 (esp.) to utter the syllable ओम्, Br.; ChUp.; ŚrS.

P. -णुदति, ˚ते, (inf. नो॑दम्, RV.), to push on, propel, set in motion, drive or scare away, RV. &c. &c.:
Caus. -णोदयति to push or thrust away, KaṭhUp.;
to move, excite, Pañcat.;
to press a person to do anything (2 acc.), Var.

or प्रान् (प्र-√ अन्) P. प्राणिति (Pāṇ. viii, 4, 19, Sch.; impf. प्राणत्, vii, 3, 99, Sch.) or प्रानिति (Vop.), to breathe in, inhale, KenUp.;
to breathe, RV.; AV.; ŚBr.; Up.;
to blow (as the wind), AitBr.;
to live, AV.; Bhaṭṭ.;
to smell, Śaṃk. :
Caus. प्राणयति (aor. प्राणिणत्, Pāṇ. viii, 4, 21, Sch.), to cause to breathe, animate, AV.; Bhaṭṭ. :
Desid. प्राणिणिषति, Pāṇ. viii, 4, 21, Sch.
